    "updated_at": "2022-05-06T00:42:58Z",
    "body": "Regarding `<embed>` and `<object>`, are these subresource requests? Currently the fetch spec doesn't expect early hints for sub resource fetch (Step 1 of https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#fetching). Are preload requests should reach to the server still?\r\n\r\nCurrently Chrome intentionally ignores early hints for subframe navigation (`<iframe>`) to be conservative (avoid security/privacy implications which we aren't aware of).\r\n\r\nAnyway I guess we might want to write WPTs which check these preloads aren't visible to the document using [isPreloadedByEarlyHints()](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/7a485087b29eaca1af9d72f348906df14fefecba/loading/early-hints/resources/early-hints-helpers.sub.js#L87) ?",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
