    "created_at": "2022-05-18T06:37:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-05-18T06:37:48Z",
    "body": "> I didn't add general tests for iframe with early hints. Would it be nice to have spec discussion first?\r\n\r\nGood point. So for iframe navigations, I don't see a reason why they wouldn't be allowed to include early hints. Early hints could be very useful in complicated document embedded as iframes.\r\n\r\nPerhaps we would want to allow `X-Frame-Options` in the early hint response to allow the iframe to not load those hints at all if it's nested. I understand why this was excluded from the initial implementation.\r\n\r\n@domenic, @yoavweiss, thoughts?",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/1129627998/reactions",
      "total_count": 0,
