      "site_admin": false
    },
    "created_at": "2022-05-18T16:28:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-05-18T16:28:29Z",
    "body": "I don't have a lot of domain expertise in what people want to use early hints and link headers for, so my opinion shouldn't carry much weight. But just from a high-level HTML spec editor view, it doesn't seem like there's anything top-frame-specific about the spec, and so allowing it on all frames makes sense to me.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
